# Cron entries for macOS / Linux. Install with:  crontab -e   (then paste, with your paths)
# Replace /path/to/bikeshare-stockouts with the absolute path to your clone, and use the
# Python inside your virtualenv so cron finds pandas/pyarrow (cron has a minimal PATH).
#
# min hour day month weekday  command
# Poll every 5 minutes. Output goes to the collector's own log (data/gbfs/logs/), so
# cron's mail is silenced with >/dev/null.
*/5 * * * * cd /path/to/bikeshare-stockouts && .venv/bin/python ingest/gbfs_collector.py --once >/dev/null 2>&1

# Daily health check at 08:00 local time: checks yesterday (UTC), shows a desktop
# notification if snapshots are missing, and writes data/gbfs/health/<date>.md.
0 8 * * * cd /path/to/bikeshare-stockouts && .venv/bin/python ingest/gbfs_health_check.py >> data/gbfs/logs/health.log 2>&1
